UNIT AI CONTROLS\n\n
Sometimes you'll decide you want your units to behave differently from each other. You can specify how you want each unit to act, issuing orders to scout, harass, or search and destroy. In this mission you'll learn how easy it is to adjust all the variables and customize your army for devastating results.  
